WEBVTT

00:11.460 --> 00:19.800
<b>My Daughter Left the Nest and Returned an S-Rank Adventurer</b>

01:30.790 --> 01:36.240
<b>Episode 13 "I'm Home, Dad"</b>

01:38.570 --> 01:40.720
His Highness has summoned you. Come.

01:41.250 --> 01:45.780
Yeah? What's the grand duke 
want with a bum like me?

01:46.360 --> 01:48.150
Oh, don't worry about that.

01:51.250 --> 01:54.420
Take me wherever you will.

01:57.490 --> 02:00.250
Now, please wait until it's time for the ball.

02:01.760 --> 02:04.470
I wonder if he's still down there...

02:09.850 --> 02:11.360
Where is he?

02:11.360 --> 02:12.700
Well, well.

02:13.140 --> 02:16.640
What's a little mouse like you doing here?

02:16.870 --> 02:19.650
Nothing. I was just out for a walk.

02:20.300 --> 02:21.660
Very well.

02:23.090 --> 02:24.990
No need to be so guarded.

02:24.990 --> 02:28.150
I know I couldn't beat you in a fight.

02:28.150 --> 02:29.650
Do you need something?

02:31.820 --> 02:35.180
I've been meaning to ask if the 
estate is to your liking.

02:35.450 --> 02:40.680
Or are S-rank adventurers no 
longer impressed by such things?

02:40.680 --> 02:44.180
I don't know what you're up to,
 but I've had enough.

02:45.220 --> 02:46.780
Don't be so cross.

02:46.780 --> 02:50.080
I'm the family outcast. 
You know what that's like?

02:50.080 --> 02:52.690
Aren't adventurers outcasts as well?

02:52.690 --> 02:55.690
No. Don't compare me to you.

02:55.690 --> 02:59.850
Of course. At rank S, 
you're part of the elite.

02:59.850 --> 03:01.920
You're not like other adventurers.

03:01.920 --> 03:06.710
Do you have any idea how it feels to be unable
to climb up, no matter how hard you try?

03:09.480 --> 03:11.870
I've prepared some entertainment for you.

03:11.870 --> 03:14.700
I hope you're looking forward to the ball.

03:19.860 --> 03:21.800
He's really taking it out on me.

03:21.800 --> 03:24.720
I wish the nobles would stick 
to fighting each other.

03:40.200 --> 03:42.450
<i>I wanna go home...</i>

03:42.450 --> 03:44.680
Hello. You look bored.

03:45.320 --> 03:50.780
Such a lovely lady 
shouldn't be hiding over here.

03:51.470 --> 03:53.130
Let's dance.

03:53.130 --> 03:54.750
Actually, um...

03:55.190 --> 03:56.990
I'll lead.

03:56.990 --> 03:58.150
W-Wait—

03:58.150 --> 03:59.900
I'm impressed.

03:59.900 --> 04:02.250
I was having trouble finding you.

04:02.250 --> 04:04.880
I see you've already caught her.

04:05.120 --> 04:07.180
She's nice.

04:07.180 --> 04:08.630
What's your name?

04:08.900 --> 04:10.900
It's Angeline.

04:11.250 --> 04:14.730
Angeline? A fine name. I'll remember it.

04:14.730 --> 04:16.660
So, when is the ceremony?

04:16.660 --> 04:20.940
Soon. The hall is being 
prepared as we speak.

04:20.940 --> 04:23.400
Your Highness! Has she given you offense?

04:24.860 --> 04:28.360
I simply invited her to dance.

04:29.570 --> 04:32.430
It was <i>my</i> idea to invite her here today!

04:32.430 --> 04:33.300
Oh?

04:33.300 --> 04:35.560
You're being rude. Show some restraint.

04:35.560 --> 04:37.950
O-Of course, Brother.

04:37.950 --> 04:41.600
By the way, who's this, uh... gentleman?

04:42.230 --> 04:46.300
Y-You fool! You don't even 
know who this man is?!

04:46.300 --> 04:49.600
Behold His Majesty's heir, Prince Benjamin!

04:50.380 --> 04:53.260
This man is the crown prince?

04:54.090 --> 04:56.280
Nice to meet you, Angeline.

04:59.610 --> 05:03.280
Thank you for coming today, lords and ladies.

05:03.940 --> 05:09.280
We are delighted to see you all doing well.

05:10.850 --> 05:13.510
Hey, what's the crown prince like?

05:13.510 --> 05:16.660
As you can see, 
he's a man of unrivaled beauty.

05:16.660 --> 05:18.210
And not just that.

05:18.210 --> 05:20.970
He's a skilled scholar and warrior 
who's charismatic to boot.

05:20.970 --> 05:24.620
He's so overwhelmingly exceptional, 
there was no succession dispute.

05:25.390 --> 05:28.130
So he's a perfect superhuman.

05:28.420 --> 05:33.470
Though until a few years ago,
 people thought him an utter fool.

05:33.470 --> 05:38.390
He used his good looks to deceive 
many a woman and spent money lavishly.

05:38.950 --> 05:40.780
But he's changed since?

05:40.780 --> 05:42.860
Yes, and very suddenly.

05:44.510 --> 05:48.540
Ladies and gentlemen, today 
we've invited a most unusual guest!

05:48.540 --> 05:53.910
Though there are many heroes, 
few can say they've slain a demon king.

05:53.910 --> 05:59.400
I present you Angeline
the Black-Haired Valkyrie!

06:07.100 --> 06:13.300
She deserves to be recognized for 
her skill in felling the demon king!

06:17.040 --> 06:22.500
Father, grant this hero an 
honor worthy of her deeds.

06:22.500 --> 06:24.100
One moment, please.

06:24.100 --> 06:25.940
Francois, cease this at once!

06:25.940 --> 06:29.020
You're in the presence of our 
father and the crown prince!

06:29.400 --> 06:32.770
Don't shout, Brother.

06:33.590 --> 06:37.790
You must have a reason for 
interrupting the ceremony.

06:39.220 --> 06:40.790
Of course.

06:41.140 --> 06:43.650
She claims to have slain a demon king.

06:43.650 --> 06:46.540
That's certainly quite the achievement...

06:46.540 --> 06:50.300
assuming it's true.

06:50.810 --> 06:54.790
Wh-What?! Are you accusing her of lying?

06:54.790 --> 06:56.960
That's what I'd like to confirm.

06:56.960 --> 06:58.320
H-How?

06:58.580 --> 07:01.160
A demonstration of her 
skills would be quickest.

07:01.900 --> 07:07.060
But no ordinary opponent could
 face an alleged demon king slayer.

07:07.450 --> 07:10.810
So I've brought a suitable combatant.

07:11.330 --> 07:13.210
You know him as well.

07:13.210 --> 07:18.160
He's the hero who slew the Master of the Void,
 the fiend that attacked the empire.

07:18.530 --> 07:20.660
They call him the Sky Shatterer.

07:28.860 --> 07:31.230
Hey. Fancy meeting you here.

07:35.350 --> 07:38.760
This vagrant is the Sky Shatterer?

07:38.760 --> 07:41.470
I shall prove it to you.

07:41.470 --> 07:46.590
He will demonstrate the spell he used to slay
the Master of the Void, Hart Langer's Spear.

07:47.050 --> 07:47.760
Do it.

07:50.790 --> 07:57.270
Threads twist into strings at my fingertip, 
shattering the jaws of distant restraints...

08:02.380 --> 08:05.670
You're sure it's okay to fire? 
This'll blow the roof off.

08:05.670 --> 08:07.290
Now, hold on.

08:07.290 --> 08:10.020
What do you think, Brother?

08:11.230 --> 08:15.770
Please, Sky Shatterer. 
Don't destroy the hall.

08:15.770 --> 08:20.030
You've proven your identity, 
so could you settle down?

08:27.760 --> 08:29.750
Now this is interesting.

08:29.750 --> 08:32.790
I'd love the opportunity to see her abilities.

08:33.900 --> 08:36.840
It seems we have His Highness's approval.

08:36.840 --> 08:40.480
This is the perfect chance
 to see what you can really do.

08:40.480 --> 08:42.780
Fight well.

08:53.060 --> 08:53.780
Take it.

09:06.830 --> 09:07.930
Why, you...!

09:07.930 --> 09:12.420
Heed me. My skills are
 not for your entertainment.

09:12.420 --> 09:16.710
They are for protecting the weak 
and defeating evil monsters.

09:16.960 --> 09:19.200
I refuse to put on a show!

09:19.200 --> 09:22.280
Mock me for being a coward if you wish.

09:22.280 --> 09:25.900
What meaning is there in an honor 
bestowed for such a display?

09:25.900 --> 09:29.300
If you're a noble, where is your dignity?!

09:32.900 --> 09:34.810
You're right.

09:37.210 --> 09:41.470
Angeline, you are truly dignified.

09:41.470 --> 09:44.920
Forgive my sons for being so rude.

09:46.930 --> 09:51.440
I never thought I'd see the day an 
adventurer taught nobles how to behave.

09:51.440 --> 09:53.930
I am delighted.

09:54.350 --> 09:57.430
I ask that you accept this honor.

09:57.940 --> 10:02.400
Your noble heart is most deserving of it.

10:02.400 --> 10:04.960
Do you agree, Your Highness?

10:06.550 --> 10:07.950
No objections here.

10:08.390 --> 10:11.950
Angeline, will you accept?

10:15.730 --> 10:17.960
I humbly accept.

10:35.730 --> 10:37.890
I have but one question for you.

10:37.890 --> 10:40.750
Where did you learn such integrity?

10:40.980 --> 10:42.660
From my father.

10:42.660 --> 10:46.410
I see. He must be a great man.

10:46.660 --> 10:49.850
Yes! He's the best father in the world.

10:51.760 --> 10:53.000
Damn!

10:53.000 --> 10:55.380
How dare she embarrass me...

10:55.380 --> 10:57.460
Give it up already.

10:58.030 --> 11:01.910
I admire a woman who can speak 
her mind to a grand duke.

11:01.910 --> 11:04.600
You don't stand a chance against her.

11:04.600 --> 11:09.580
Damn it. I should've let you fire your spell.

11:09.580 --> 11:12.630
I could've taken advantage of the 
confusion to pull off a coup d'état—

11:14.880 --> 11:17.120
Hello, Francois.

11:17.790 --> 11:19.700
Your Highness...

11:19.700 --> 11:24.030
I'm disappointed. I thought 
you had a wonderful idea.

11:24.530 --> 11:26.130
What do you mean?

11:26.370 --> 11:31.420
I wanted to see the Black-Haired 
Valkyrie fight the Sky Shatterer.

11:32.630 --> 11:35.120
Ah, you agree?

11:35.370 --> 11:39.600
You don't often get to see 
S-ranks fight to the death.

11:40.350 --> 11:42.380
You wouldn't hold back, would you?

11:43.900 --> 11:45.850
I don't rightly care.

11:45.850 --> 11:49.900
I think she'd be able to kill me, though.

11:49.900 --> 11:53.480
Why not take care of the girl?

11:53.480 --> 11:55.900
You have him at your disposal.

11:56.330 --> 11:59.400
If that is your wish, Your Highness.

12:05.770 --> 12:08.370
You had me worried.

12:09.060 --> 12:11.780
To be honest, I wasn't sure what to do.

12:12.330 --> 12:16.290
Sorry, Gil, but I couldn't take it anymore.

12:17.400 --> 12:19.050
You did well.

12:19.410 --> 12:23.680
I'm thinking of writing a letter 
since I can't go back to Turnera.

12:24.270 --> 12:26.540
Do you think my father will praise me?

12:26.540 --> 12:30.970
Of course! I have no doubt 
he'll say he's proud of you.

12:30.970 --> 12:34.340
He might be so thrilled
that he'll run straight to Orphen.

12:34.340 --> 12:38.560
But I'm not sure you can deliver
 a letter to Turnera in winter...

12:39.890 --> 12:41.330
So be it.

12:41.330 --> 12:43.990
I'll tell him about it the next time I'm home.

12:44.620 --> 12:45.580
Well then...

12:45.900 --> 12:49.100
I'm going to the inn to prepare 
for the journey back.

12:49.100 --> 12:50.560
See you later.

12:55.430 --> 12:56.830
You came.

12:56.830 --> 12:59.570
We'll meet again, right?

13:00.580 --> 13:03.180
Come visit me next time.

13:07.100 --> 13:08.070
Okay!

13:08.640 --> 13:10.180
It's a promise.

13:10.180 --> 13:12.560
Oh, I know...

13:13.280 --> 13:15.340
Take that dress with you.

13:15.340 --> 13:17.130
You can keep it.

13:17.130 --> 13:19.370
What? I can't do that...

13:19.370 --> 13:21.200
Besides, I have nowhere to wear it.

13:21.200 --> 13:24.070
It's fine. It's a token of our friendship.

13:24.070 --> 13:25.860
Right? That's fine, isn't it?

13:27.190 --> 13:29.990
Okay. Thank you for the gift.

13:29.990 --> 13:32.040
I'll wear it for my dad.

13:32.310 --> 13:35.660
It looked wonderful on you. 
I'm sure he'll compliment you on it.

13:36.590 --> 13:37.420
Thanks.

13:49.760 --> 13:51.010
What do you want?

13:51.280 --> 13:55.520
Your high and mighty speech 
disgusts me, you hypocrite.

13:55.780 --> 13:59.600
There are no hypocrites when 
it comes to doing good deeds.

13:59.600 --> 14:00.800
Are you dumb or what?

14:00.800 --> 14:02.680
My lord, give the word.

14:02.680 --> 14:05.650
Don't. Do you really think you can beat me?

14:09.030 --> 14:12.280
How did things turn out like this?

14:13.820 --> 14:16.110
I could ask you the same thing.

14:16.110 --> 14:17.140
You'd fight me?

14:17.140 --> 14:19.390
I don't have anything better to do.

14:23.680 --> 14:28.050
I don't want to fight you, Mr. Kasim.

14:28.370 --> 14:29.750
That right?

14:29.750 --> 14:32.810
I think you could kill me if you wanted to.

14:33.870 --> 14:35.800
You want to die? But why?

14:37.240 --> 14:39.380
Because I'm a coward.

14:39.380 --> 14:43.310
I'm scared to die, but I'm tired of living.

14:43.730 --> 14:49.490
If I'm gonna eat it, I'd rather go 
fighting someone stronger than me.

14:50.150 --> 14:53.820
Let's not do this. 
Your death would sadden Lise.

14:59.200 --> 15:01.660
Why are you doing what they tell you?!

15:01.660 --> 15:07.240
When people lose heart, they go wild.

15:07.870 --> 15:12.610
You could say I pity myself
and my tragic circumstances.

15:14.150 --> 15:18.010
Or perhaps I'm trying to atone for my sins.

15:18.620 --> 15:22.930
But you're strong. You don't 
have to be so hard on yourself.

15:24.780 --> 15:25.940
You're so young.

15:36.270 --> 15:38.910
I used to think the same way.

15:38.910 --> 15:41.450
That I could do anything 
just because I was strong.

15:42.140 --> 15:44.390
My friend was distraught.

15:44.390 --> 15:48.960
But he was such a good guy
he tried to make sure no one knew.

15:49.260 --> 15:53.470
And that hurt because 
we couldn't tell what was going on.

15:53.870 --> 15:58.560
What use is it being a good fighter
in a struggle like that?

15:58.560 --> 16:02.700
Strength wasn't what I needed.
It was something else altogether.

16:06.390 --> 16:12.010
I thought I could find the answer 
if I climbed even higher,

16:12.010 --> 16:14.480
but I was just fooling myself.

16:15.220 --> 16:19.920
To cut to the chase, 
I stopped caring about anything.

16:24.890 --> 16:27.740
I can't die here.

16:28.040 --> 16:30.720
I don't care if I do.

16:30.720 --> 16:32.260
Don't hold back.

16:32.260 --> 16:34.260
Don't worry!

16:34.540 --> 16:39.510
Once you're dead, I'll send your supposedly 
peerless father right after you!

16:40.130 --> 16:41.460
Don't be ridiculous!

16:41.460 --> 16:45.230
My father is Belgrieve the Red Ogre!

16:45.230 --> 16:48.170
He'd destroy you in an instant!

16:55.180 --> 16:56.990
Y-You...

16:57.360 --> 16:58.700
Wh-What?

16:58.700 --> 17:01.850
Did you just say "Belgrieve"?

17:01.850 --> 17:04.210
He's your father?

17:05.190 --> 17:06.450
That's what I said, yes.

17:07.420 --> 17:11.800
I knew it! Is he missing his right leg?

17:12.490 --> 17:15.300
Yes. Do you know him?

17:15.680 --> 17:17.930
Of course I do! We're...

17:18.450 --> 17:23.310
W-We're friends. 
If he still thinks so, anyway.

17:23.310 --> 17:25.500
I don't know what the story is,

17:25.500 --> 17:30.060
but my father's not the kind of
 petty man to hold a grudge.

17:31.600 --> 17:35.380
You got that right!
Seeing you fills me with hope.

17:35.380 --> 17:37.940
Tell me more about Bel.

17:37.940 --> 17:40.070
Who'd he marry and have you with?

17:40.800 --> 17:42.390
You look nothing like him.

17:42.390 --> 17:44.120
Actually, he took me in.

17:44.120 --> 17:45.520
What? He did?

17:45.520 --> 17:47.510
Hey, what are you doing?

17:47.030 --> 17:48.590
Tell me more about—

17:47.510 --> 17:49.540
Destroy her! Do you hear me?

17:48.970 --> 17:49.840
Shut up!

17:53.900 --> 17:55.900
Man, that was close.

17:55.900 --> 17:58.540
I nearly killed my friend's daughter.

17:58.540 --> 18:00.790
I might've won, you know.

18:00.790 --> 18:02.520
Ha, no doubt about it!

18:02.520 --> 18:05.200
You're leaving the estate, right?

18:05.670 --> 18:07.620
I'll go with you.

18:07.620 --> 18:08.790
What? But...

18:08.790 --> 18:11.110
Tell me more about Bel.

18:11.110 --> 18:14.440
I'll tell you about his past, too.

18:14.440 --> 18:16.210
Got it!

18:16.210 --> 18:18.770
I can talk about Dad all night long!

18:19.400 --> 18:21.570
That's the spirit.

18:26.060 --> 18:28.740
What a letdown.

18:28.740 --> 18:34.290
I thought I'd get a better sense of her 
strength against the Sky Shatterer.

18:34.290 --> 18:40.670
And we must find a key soon so we 
can determine if she's a success.

18:41.380 --> 18:43.320
Do not worry.

18:43.320 --> 18:46.060
You're too serious.

18:47.040 --> 18:50.850
Is disguising yourself as the crown prince
 your idea of entertainment?

18:52.670 --> 18:54.380
It's pretty fun.

18:55.000 --> 18:57.490
I'm leaving now. Keep your wits about you.

19:00.370 --> 19:02.690
You too, Schwartz.

19:09.530 --> 19:11.380
The Sky Shatterer, huh?

19:12.050 --> 19:14.810
He <i>was</i> pretty talented.

19:16.780 --> 19:18.770
Welcome back, Ange!

19:18.770 --> 19:20.310
I made it.

19:19.170 --> 19:20.790
Ah, she's home.

19:21.550 --> 19:24.750
Hey, I'm glad you made the trip.

19:24.750 --> 19:26.460
Welcome home, Ange.

19:27.020 --> 19:28.800
Thanks.

19:29.140 --> 19:33.570
But I wish my dad were 
here to welcome me back...

19:37.120 --> 19:38.230
Ange.

19:40.000 --> 19:40.960
What?

19:40.960 --> 19:42.490
How was Estogal?

19:43.600 --> 19:44.990
Dad!

19:46.160 --> 19:48.760
Dad, Dad, Dad!

19:49.880 --> 19:51.520
What am I going to do with you?

19:52.900 --> 19:57.630
Oh, right! I met your old friend.

20:07.630 --> 20:09.150
What are you doing?

20:09.540 --> 20:13.420
You didn't tell me he was in Orphen.

20:13.420 --> 20:15.130
I'm not ready yet.

20:15.430 --> 20:16.470
Seriously?

20:18.630 --> 20:20.660
Is that you, Kasim?

20:22.340 --> 20:25.150
You grew out your beard, Bel.

20:30.150 --> 20:31.330
So have you.

20:34.400 --> 20:36.340
Oh, Ange!

20:36.340 --> 20:40.210
It's true. When I decide to do something...

20:38.730 --> 20:44.410
After you left Orphen, 
Percy and Satie didn't smile anymore.

20:44.980 --> 20:46.730
It's ironic.

20:46.730 --> 20:49.170
We all wanted to help you,

20:49.810 --> 20:52.820
but we all started hating each other.

20:53.430 --> 20:59.830
Percy and Satie fought all the time, 
and I didn't know what to do.

21:00.690 --> 21:02.280
So you split up?

21:02.720 --> 21:03.690
Yeah.

21:04.060 --> 21:08.320
Satie left. Then Percy and
 I went our separate ways.

21:08.320 --> 21:10.600
I was desperate.

21:11.060 --> 21:15.700
I reached S-rank and became 
a great mage, but it was all in vain.

21:16.010 --> 21:19.650
I got older, but I'm still a kid inside.

21:19.650 --> 21:22.180
I know you had it the hardest, too.

21:23.670 --> 21:27.320
You know, I was jealous of you guys.

21:27.840 --> 21:29.020
What?

21:29.020 --> 21:33.400
You three were overflowing 
with confidence and talent,

21:33.400 --> 21:35.850
and I couldn't acknowledge my own worth.

21:35.850 --> 21:38.340
You're wrong! That's not...

21:38.610 --> 21:44.720
But I was able to move forward 
because I lost my leg.

21:44.720 --> 21:46.110
I met Ange.

21:48.530 --> 21:51.870
And now I've been reunited 
with you thanks to her.

21:52.390 --> 21:55.560
For me, she's the future.

21:57.330 --> 21:58.860
The future, huh?

21:59.340 --> 22:02.300
I've been stuck in the past all this time.

22:02.300 --> 22:04.770
It's good to see you again, Kasim.

22:04.770 --> 22:08.280
I'm sorry for hurting you. And thank you.

22:12.850 --> 22:14.720
I'm sorry, Bel!

22:15.250 --> 22:16.150
Thank you!

22:19.840 --> 22:21.970
Let's drink tonight.

22:22.860 --> 22:25.240
Everyone wants to hear your stories.

22:25.240 --> 22:26.230
Yeah.

22:27.700 --> 22:30.160
Huh? Where'd they go?

22:30.160 --> 22:32.980
I ch-changed my mind.
This is too embarrassing.

22:39.410 --> 22:43.640
U-Um, they gave me this dress to take home.

22:43.640 --> 22:46.920
Wh-What do you think, Dad?

22:48.300 --> 22:51.820
Ange, you've grown into a fine young woman.

22:51.820 --> 22:53.930
It looks great on you.

22:57.680 --> 23:01.450
Dad, let's toast to your 
reunion with Mr. Kasim!

23:01.830 --> 23:03.030
Thank you.

23:03.680 --> 23:05.380
Oh, by the way, Ange...

23:05.380 --> 23:07.210
What is it, Dad?

23:07.210 --> 23:09.940
What's this about finding me a wife?

23:10.460 --> 23:15.530
I got scolded for having 
my daughter play matchmaker.

23:15.820 --> 23:18.540
U-Um, I...

23:19.910 --> 23:23.730
I'm giving you a hard time.
Just don't do it again.

